    "affected_api": "pandas.Interval.overlaps",
    "observed_behavior": "Interval(0, 1, closed='both').overlaps(Interval(0, 0, closed='right')) returns True, and Interval(-1, 1, closed='both').overlaps(Interval(0, 0, closed='neither')) returns True. The result depends on which side of the empty interval is closed.",
